<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Learn how information is handled when you use ThemeBuilder.">
  <title>Privacy | ThemeBuilder Support</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/support-site.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("partials/site-header", { activePage: "privacy" }) %>

  <main class="document-page legal-page">
    <div class="document-heading">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Support home</a>
      <span class="eyebrow">POLICIES</span>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="document-intro">An overview of information related to your use of ThemeBuilder.</p>
    </div>
    <article class="legal-content">
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: October 13, 2026</p>
      <section>
        <h2>1. Information you provide</h2>
        <p>When you use ThemeBuilder or contact support, you may provide information such as your name, email address, account details, and the contents of your message. Please do not send passwords or other sensitive credentials by email.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>2. Information related to service use</h2>
        <p>Information may be processed to provide and maintain the service, manage accounts and permissions, respond to support requests, and protect the service. Depending on the features and integrations in use, this may include account settings, theme configuration, and technical information needed to operate the service.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>3. How information is used</h2>
        <p>Information is used to provide the features you request, administer access, troubleshoot issues, communicate about support, and maintain the security and operation of ThemeBuilder. Information may also be used where required by law.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>4. Sharing and third parties</h2>
        <p>Information may be available to service providers or third-party platforms that help operate or integrate with ThemeBuilder, and may be disclosed when required by law or necessary to protect rights and safety. Third-party services are governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>5. Retention and security</h2>
        <p>Information is retained for as long as needed for the purposes described here or as required by applicable law. Reasonable measures are used to protect information, but no method of storage or transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>6. Your choices and questions</h2>
        <p>You may contact us to ask about a privacy request relating to your information. We may need to verify your identity or direct you to your account administrator to handle the request.</p>
        <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:haseebharry07@gmail.com">haseebharry07@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>7. Updates to this page</h2>
        <p>This privacy information may be updated from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised update date.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>

  <%- include("partials/site-footer") %>
</body>
</html>
